<title>FINLAND: Amer Jan-April loss more than halves.</title>
<headline>Amer Jan-April loss more than halves.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April, 1997</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss before extraordinary items, tax	  49 vs 114</p>
<p> Loss per share (markka)			 2.20 vs 4.90</p>
<p> Net sales					  1,477 vs 1,615</p>
<p> Operating loss					12 vs 76</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of nine analysts' forecast for Finnish sporting goods group Amer-Yhtyma Oy's January-April loss before extraordinaries and tax had been 53 million markka in a 30-90 million range.  </p>
<p> Depreciation					  68 vs 85</p>
<p> Net financial items			charge 37 vs 38 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs 2 charge</p>
<p> Minorities					     1 vs 2</p>
<p> Taxes						    2 vs nil</p>
<p> Net loss						52 vs 118</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)		40 vs 44 (end-1996)</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Amer-Yhtyma Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245, news@reuters.fi</p>
